{
    "title": "ID Photo - Easy ID Maker",
    "description": "ID Photo is an advanced application designed to meet your various identity verification needs. Whether you need an ID card, passport, visa, driver's license, resume photo, certificate, or a photo for social platforms, ID Photo provides comprehensive support. No registration required, use it immediately after downloading.\r\n\r\nThis app uses the latest automatic portrait recognition technology to quickly generate the ID photos you need.\r\n\r\nProduct Features:\r\n\r\n\u2728 Automatic Portrait Recognition: ID Photo uses advanced detection technology to automatically identify and adjust user portraits.\r\n\r\n\u2728 Multiple Document Specifications: Supports various document photo sizes for passports, visas, driver's licenses, etc., meeting international requirements.\r\n\r\n\u2728 Tone Adjustment: Offers multiple editing options to help improve photo quality.\r\n\r\n\u2728 Multiple Resolutions: Supports different resolutions to accommodate different usage needs.\r\n\r\n\u2728 User-Friendly Interface: ID Photo features a simple and intuitive user interface that is easy to use without a complex learning process.\r\n\r\nChoose ID Photo for the fastest and most convenient ID photo creation experience. Whether updating a passport or needing a formal resume photo, ID Photo provides professional support and services",
